# The image takes only what docker/Dockerfile copies; everything else (git history, tests, docs, local saves,
# node_modules, _site) stays out of the build context.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!src/
!site/
!scripts/
!tests/harness.js
!docker/docker-entrypoint.sh
# This fork's game image (Dockerfile, built the release way with scripts/build.js, which bakes the CHANGELOG's notes)
# and its cloud sync server (docker/sync.Dockerfile, docker-compose.yml).
!CHANGELOG.md
!docker/nginx.conf
!server/
